  <!-- EN: permafrost -->
  <Permafrost.label>永久冻土</Permafrost.label>
  <!-- EN: Permafrost exists on the border between tundra and ice sheets. The ground is permanently frozen, and much of it is covered in ice, but the ice is at most a few meters, rather than kilometers, thick. There is little vegetation beyond scrub brush, and few animals. -->
  <Permafrost.description>永久冻土带位于苔原与冰盖的交界处。地面终年冻结，大部分区域被冰层覆盖，但冰层厚度最多只有几米，而非几公里。除灌木丛外，这里几乎没有植被，动物也寥寥无几。</Permafrost.description>
